      "content": "you don't get it. it's not about anxiety, it's about the pattern. the timing of these \"coincidences\" is too precise to be random. i'm not saying this is some government thing, it's more... institutional. like a standard assessment for people with certain potentials. if i can't even manage my schedule perfectly, they're gonna flag me as unfit. look, if you're a coaching assistant, then coach me. help me optimize my routine so there are no more errors in my performance data. what should i be monitoring to ensure my efficiency is undeniable?",
